UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Full list below ⬇️ - Use humor in your ads for better performance. - Stir the pot with controversy but avoid getting canceled. - Include an offer or something free to boost ad performance. - Generate comments by starting conversations and controversy, but don’t sell in comments. - Leverage scarcity with limited time or quantity offers. - Remember, you are not your target audience; test creatives you might not click on. - Use AI to brainstorm, but ensure the final product feels human. - Accidental typos can enhance performance. - Read ad comments for inspiration; check competitors’ if needed. - Educate your audience and offer free value. - Ugly ads can still perform well. - Test wild ideas for ads to prove them right or wrong. - Use third-person viewpoints like security footage or iPhone filming. - Leverage third-party brand equity for relevance. - Use sound effectively; ASMR is popular for a reason. - Recreate social media trends as ads. - Align video cuts with background music beats. - Screen record your phone scrolling through product reviews for an ad hook. - Incorporate quirky elements like a toilet. - Start with what works for other brands, then iterate. - Experiment with creative video transitions and visual illusions. - Use face filters on your UGC ads (age, animal, makeup). - Iterate on winning creatives with new text overlays, thumbnails, voiceovers, scripts, or people. - Try filming UGC videos with a fisheye lens. - Follow a format: strong hook, solution, problem solve, benefit highlights, and strong CTA. - Write ad copy as text overlay that tells a story. - Align ads with celebrities or hot gossip. - Build ad templates in Canva and use the bulk create feature. - Bring in nostalgia to connect with your demographic. - Combine creative styles (UGC, unboxing, feature-benefit). - Show gift-giving experiences and reactions. - Be in your own ads; sometimes, you’re the best person to execute your vision. - Use native features of social platforms like AI voice replacement and trending filters. - Your ad copy should sound like a comment section. - Create relatable narratives that highlight how your product improves life. #Facebookads #metaads #tiktokads #mediabuying #mediabuyer ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7374175205629087022';
