UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Homemade Mozzarella Cheese 😁  #homemade #mozzarella #cheese #easyrecipe #cheeserecipe #cheesemaking #fyp  Mozzarella Cheese  1/2 Gallon Whole Milk 5 TBS Vinger  Heat milk in a large saucepan over medium-high heat just till it reaches 110-115°F. Next mix in vinegar and mix til you notice the milk starts to curd. Turn off heat. Cover the milk and let set for 15 minutes. After 15 minutes it should be separated. Now strain the whey from the curd and squeeze out as much liquid as possible. Reheat the cheese in the microwave for 30 seconds. Stretch the cheese and fold into itself til smooth and elastic about 1 minute. Form mozzarella into a ball and chill in cold water for 15 more minutes.  Slice and enjoy.  Store in airtight container 😁' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7353416651221634347';
