UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'FOUNDERS: an overstaffed HR department could kill your company last week on e168, chamath and sacks discussed how bloated HR departments create major distractions and massively slow companies down today, @micsolana''s @piratewires piece "Google''s Culture of Fear" is raising eyebrows for exposing the company''s wacky "sprawling HR bureaucracy" chamath does not have an HR department at ANY company where he has majority control he uses this three-step plan instead: 1) use a trusted third-party law firm that specializes in employment law to handle complaints - NOT HR 2) let your team build their own benefits package based on a diverse set of needs - NOT HR 3) department heads (head of sales, head of eng, etc.) are responsible for the hiring process - NOT HR #hr #business #fyp #investing #startup #technology #allinpodcast ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7347747612675542314';
UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'This advice came from a board member and mentor of a very successful tech company and is some of the best motivational career advice I got early in my career.  Especially women in corporate settings tend to get distracted by big asks that don''t move the number the corporation actually cares about. We are so busy, but not on the thing that our success is judged on. The more focused you can be on the metric that executives care the most about, and the more you can connect your work to that metric, the more value you will be perceived as delivering. That''s the career advice I got and would share with women around me now.  #careeradvice #corporatelife #careeradviceforwomen #motivationmonday #careertiktok #corporate ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7345124994734738730';
